@page "/faq"

<SeoHead Title="Bansuri Lessons FAQ | Flute With Kuldeep"
         Description="Answers about learning Bansuri online, choosing a beginner flute, lesson availability, practice time, and Hindustani classical music."
         CanonicalUrl="https://flutewithkuldeep.com/faq" />

<div class="seo-page-shell">
    <header class="seo-page-header">
        <nav class="seo-page seo-page-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <NavLink href="">Home</NavLink>
            <NavLink href="about">About</NavLink>
            <NavLink href="classes">Classes</NavLink>
            <NavLink href="contact">Contact</NavLink>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="seo-page seo-page-main">
        <h1>Online Bansuri Classes FAQ</h1>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <details open>
                <summary>Can beginners learn Bansuri online?</summary>
                <p>Yes. Live video lessons make it possible to learn posture, breath, tone, fingering, and simple melodies with direct feedback.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Which Bansuri should I buy as a beginner?</summary>
                <p>A medium-sized bamboo flute that feels comfortable is usually best. Ask Kuldeep for a scale recommendation before buying.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>How long does it take to learn Bansuri?</summary>
                <p>Every learner progresses differently. Consistent practice builds a stable sound first, followed by fluent fingering, melody, rhythm, and raga.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Are classes available online?</summary>
                <p>Yes. One-to-one online Bansuri classes are available to students worldwide with flexible lesson scheduling.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Do you teach Hindustani classical music?</summary>
                <p>Yes. Teaching includes swara, tala, listening, Bansuri technique, ornamentation, melody, and raga-based Hindustani classical music practice.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
        <p class="seo-page-link"><NavLink href="contact">Contact Kuldeep about classes</NavLink></p>
    </main>

    <footer class="seo-page-footer">
        <nav class="seo-page seo-page-nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
            <NavLink href="">Home</NavLink>
            <NavLink href="classes">Online classes</NavLink>
            <NavLink href="about">About Kuldeep</NavLink>
        </nav>
    </footer>
</div>
